    "the lift tables are a static pre-2026-07-01 snapshot applied to a later window \u2014 champion meta drift inside the window is unmodelled noise",
    "the counter/synergy tails are partly selection: an extreme differential usually means one side got a strong champ@role, which is why the role-conditioned columns (joint fit, residual deciles) matter more than the raw gaps for any causal reading",
